WEBVTT

00:00:03.176 --> 00:00:06.736
Close Editor, and the dashboard shows the tiles.

00:00:06.736 --> 00:00:10.756
Each one names its report and says the period in words.

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:15.402
At the bottom, a tile says when its result was made, and Open

00:00:15.402 --> 00:00:20.244
the full report goes to the report itself, with every filter and export.

